Z||000007||Eric||01-25-2001||04:46 PM||||You can use plasti-cote interior spray.  They have it at any auto parts store.  Painted my interior black a couple years ago and it still looks good except for a couple areas that I needed to retouch like the door handles and consul.  I used the high gloss which looks like you just put a fresh coat of armor all on it.  I probably would have settled for something less flashy.  The glare can get kind of bad.||||reg||1
